    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/048494be14e4d1ee67fb53fb071d3e89.avif?t=1754978183\" /></div><strong>The Last Humble Bee</strong> is a heart-buzzing bumble bee rogue-like where you swashbuckle, bounce, and barrel-blast through a desaturated pixel art world to &quot;Save the Bees&quot; from eternal damnation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Play as a Swashbuckling Warrior Bee:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Jump, dodge/roll, and attack your way to bumble bee glory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Customize your own Deck of Magical Upgrades:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>A deckbuilding system enables you to choose your own (random) upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Lose yourself in huge maps, and get the zoomies:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Explore for treasure or jump into a barrel cannon to blast across the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design, Art, and Audio harken back to the days of 16-bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce over gaps! Duel with enemies! Find treasure! Uncover secrets! Upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A light touch to narrative with humor, levity, and heart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">De-saturated pixel art with big chunky outlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging gameplay that warmly welcomes newcomers, yet leaves room for expert-level maneuvering</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Developer\u2019s Note:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks so much for playing The Last Humble Bee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I consider this game complete and am now focusing on new projects, but I\u2019m really proud of what we made together. I may revisit Humble Bee down the road, but for now, I\u2019m excited to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cheers, Jacob Weersing</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/048494be14e4d1ee67fb53fb071d3e89.avif?t=1754978183\" /></div><strong>The Last Humble Bee</strong> is a heart-buzzing bumble bee rogue-like where you swashbuckle, bounce, and barrel-blast through a desaturated pixel art world to &quot;Save the Bees&quot; from eternal damnation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Play as a Swashbuckling Warrior Bee:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Jump, dodge/roll, and attack your way to bumble bee glory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Customize your own Deck of Magical Upgrades:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>A deckbuilding system enables you to choose your own (random) upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Lose yourself in huge maps, and get the zoomies:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Explore for treasure or jump into a barrel cannon to blast across the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design, Art, and Audio harken back to the days of 16-bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce over gaps! Duel with enemies! Find treasure! Uncover secrets! Upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A light touch to narrative with humor, levity, and heart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">De-saturated pixel art with big chunky outlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging gameplay that warmly welcomes newcomers, yet leaves room for expert-level maneuvering</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Developer\u2019s Note:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks so much for playing The Last Humble Bee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I consider this game complete and am now focusing on new projects, but I\u2019m really proud of what we made together. I may revisit Humble Bee down the road, but for now, I\u2019m excited to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cheers, Jacob Weersing</p>",
    "short_description": "The Last Humble Bee is a cartoony survivors-like with a lot of heart. Explore a pixelated open world, cast bumble bee magic, and slash through demonic bugs to uncover what happened to all the bumble bees.",
